*//////////////////////////////////////////////////////
* LT1362  Quad 50MHz, 800V/µs Operational Amplifier  //
*//////////////////////////////////////////////////////
*
* connections:     non-inverting input
*                  |   inverting input
*                  |   |   positive power supply
*                  |   |   |   negative power supply
*                  |   |   |   |   output
*                  |   |   |   |   |
*                  |   |   |   |   |
.SUBCKT LT1362     3   2   7   4   6 
* INPUT
RC1 7  80 7.9577E+02
RC2 7  90 7.9577E+02
Q1  80 2  10 QM1 
Q2  90 3  11 QM2 
CIN 2  3  2.0E-12
*INPUT POLE AT 300MHZ
C1  80 90 0.333E-12

*RE1 10 12 +7.7947E+02
*RE2 11 12 +7.7947E+02
*jg, 30/6/2000: corrected syntax errors.

RE1 10 12  7.7947E+02
RE2 11 12  7.7947E+02

IEE 12 4  3.2006E-03
RE  12 0  6.2488E+04
* INTERMEDIATE 
GCM 8  0  12 0  3.1565E-08
GA  8  0  78 0  1.2566E-03
R2  8  0  5.47E+06
C2  8  0  3.7E-12
DC1 8  7  DM3
DC2 4  8  DM3
*
*POLE AT 300MHZ
GX1 0  28 90 80 1E-06
RX1 28 0  1E+06
CX1 28 0  0.53E-15
